[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0010","text":"……把护目镜戴上──好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0020","text":"制作人，道具就这些了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0030","text":"拍摄要用的东西\n就剩水枪了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0040","text":"哦，这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0050","text":"……树里，\n要不要试试水枪？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0060","text":"哈……？\n不，那种东西没必要吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0070","text":"……是吗\n果穗看到这把水枪，可是两眼放光呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0080","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0090","text":"那你不早说……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21100300_01_0100","text":"──大家一起试，\n水枪试射……！！"}]
